OL,3,GNEWSASecond murder arrest over woman's
OL,4,Astabbing death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second man has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder after a woman was
OL,8,Fstabbed to death.
OL,10,FAlisha Samuels, 26, was found dead
OL,11,Fafter officers were called to reports
OL,12,Fof a disturbance on Dorking Avenue in
OL,13,FNewton Heath, Manchester, at about
OL,14,F02:00 BST on Thursday.
OL,16,FA man, 26, was arrested in Liverpool
OL,17,Fand he remains in custody for
OL,18,Fquestioning, Greater Manchester Police
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
